#: 6f15e1ffa91048a38681de94f9e4ca21
msgid ""
"This section groups hardware that may (or may not be) present on your frame,"
" including rangefinders, camera mounts, telemetry radios etc. For "
"information related to Autopilot selection see :ref:`Autopilot Hardware "
"Options <common-autopilots>`. For guidance on cable design, colour coding, "
"and EMI-compliant wiring, especially for larger vehicles with longer wiring "
"runs, see :ref:`Cable Wiring Guidelines <common-cabling-guide>`."
msgstr ""
"本节分组介绍可能（或可能不）存在于您机架上的硬件，包括测距仪、摄像头云台、数传电台等。关于飞控选择的信息，请参阅 :ref:`飞控硬件选项 "
"<common-autopilots>`。关于线缆设计、颜色编码和符合 EMI 规范的接线指南，尤其是对于接线较长的大型飞行器，请参阅 "
":ref:`线缆接线指南 <common-cabling-guide>`。"

